  "content": "<p>Telegram（电报）：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fkapiteon_mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://t.me/kapiteon_mods</a><br><br>也欢迎查看我的其他模组：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nonewfog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">NoNewFog（无新雾）</span>（NoGrayFog 无灰雾） <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">（新！）</span></a><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direction-build\" rel=\"nofollow\">Direction Build（定向建造）</a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direction-build\" rel=\"nofollow\">（按住鼠标右键时沿单一方向建造）</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastbuilder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Builder（快速建造）</a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastbuilder\" rel=\"nofollow\">（同时支持快速破坏）</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClearVision（清晰视界）</a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">（夜视 + 全亮度 + 液体透视）</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keybinder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Command Binder（指令绑定器）</a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keybinder\" rel=\"nofollow\">（按键宏）</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>FreeCam（自由视角）</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自由视角模组是一款 Forge 模组，能让你以 <em>旁观者</em> 模式在 Minecraft 世界中<em>飞行</em>。即使在 <em>在线</em> 服务器中也能正常使用。自由视角有助于探索地下世界或观察已建成的工厂。你可以任意穿过任何方块。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在在线服务器中，其他玩家和生物会看到你仍然站在原地不动。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>按下 F6 键启用/禁用 <em>FreeCam</em>（自由视角）模式<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建议搭配亮度模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClearVision（清晰视界）</a> 一起使用（<strong>按 F7 激活 ClearVision</strong>）</span></p>",
